<title>FRANCE: EU published regulation ending weekly wheat tender.</title>
<headline>EU published regulation ending weekly wheat tender.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A regulation shutting the European Union weekly tender for soft wheat exports in 1996/97 was published on April 23 in the EU Official Journal, a EU grain industry source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Regulation 708/97 was published in the Official Journal L105, the source said.</p>
<p>The text specifies that EU regulation 1143 covering the weekly soft wheat tender has been cancelled.</p>
<p>Last Thursday the European Union shut the weekly tender for soft wheat exports in 1996/97.</p>
<p>But in France exporters bid to export 25,000 tonnes of EU soft wheat at today's tender, France's ONIC reported earlier.</p>
</text>
